ion is on it, meaning you must summon everything. \"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Use the combo to open up the safe.\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Examine safe for the first time:\"]},{\"code\":356,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"ShowMessage dreamworld_extras_doomtomb.message_212\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Talk to the safe:\"]},{\"code\":356,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"ShowMessage dreamworld_extras_doomtomb.message_213\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Multiple choice with 4 random numbers each.\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Correct answer combo:\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#2\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#2\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#3\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#1\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#9\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#9\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#1\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#The safe contains RECIPE FOR DISASTER. (Item #246) \"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Get Message is in XX_MELON \"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#The screen will fade out and fade in to show the image, then fade back.\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#You can also view it through inventory.\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#The recipe requires you to sacrifice ACTUAL MOLE.\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Talk to the Mole with RECIPE FOR DISASTER:\"]},{\"code\":356,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"ShowMessage dreamworld_extras_doomtomb.message_214\"]},{\"code\":356,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"ShowMessage dreamworld_extras_doomtomb.message_215\"]},{\"code\":356,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"ShowMessage dreamworld_extras_doomtomb.message_216\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#(Note: Once you pick up the ACTUAL MOLE, you won’t be able to leave.)\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#ACTUAL MOLE is Item #248\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Talk to the summoning circle. (XX_MELON.message_79)\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#After you sacrifice the ACTUAL MOLE, the map starts rumbling, the screen begins shaking and turning black. \"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#You and your party will spawn to the top of this map. The boulder will appear and start chasing you down.\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#If you die here, it’ll play the funeral song like you died.\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Then you’ll respawn at the top of the boulder map infinitely.\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#If you fall “survive” and fall through the hole at the bottom, the screen will turn black, then there will be a falling noise and then a crash signifying you hit the ground. Then it’ll play the funeral song like you died. (Either way, you “die.”)\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Instead of GAME OVER, you find yourself in the left pantry with 3 TOASTS around you (your party members).\"]},{\"code\":108,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#OMORI pops out from the middle of the flour pile, covered in flour.\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#Orange = party members Green = Life Jam watermelons\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#You must gather the LIFE JAM around the room and use the LIFE JAM on the TOASTS to revive them.\"]},{\"code\":408,\"indent\":0,\"parameters\":[\"#After you revive each member, they join your p